      <div>
        <head>Notes</head>
        <list rend="bulleted">
          <item>Edward Latham lived in <ref target="civic?id=Barry%20Street">Barry Street</ref> from 1868 to 1872 (<ref target="civic?id=Edward%20Latham">Edward Latham</ref>).</item>
          <item>No. 166 <ref target="civic?id=Victoria%20Street">Victoria Street</ref> is listed as the Victoria Brewery Pty Ltd office in 1920 and 1930 and as the Carlton Brewery Ltd from 1910 to 1915 and in 1935 and 1940. They are kept apart because the names differ.</item>
          <item>Bond Pty Ltd, ginger preservers, are listed at 175a <ref target="civic?id=Queensberry%20Street">Queensberry Street</ref> in 1925 and 1930, and people named Brew and Brewer are listed in <ref target="civic?id=Barry%20Street">Barry Street</ref>, <ref target="civic?id=Madeline%20Street">Madeline Street</ref> and <ref target="civic?id=Leicester%20Street">Leicester Street</ref>; they are left out.</item>
        </list>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Sources</head>
        <p>Every listing can be browsed in <ref target="search?q=brewery&amp;src=directories">search</ref>. The directories are yearly to 1880 and then every five years, so years are the first and last directories that list each entry.</p>
